  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Action to Strengthen Partnerships for Inclusion Resilience and Education</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Learners in communes of Tagazar, Balleyara, Dargol and Gotheye, in Tillaberi region of Niger will improve learning outcomes, access and participation in inclusive and safe learning environmental. It will provide education pathways for marginalized, out-of-school children, girls, children with disabilities in remote areas. It will strengthen competence and wellbeing of teachers to provide effective teaching. It will build the capacity of CSOs to engage in dialogue and advocacy.</narrative>
  </description>
